@page "/pricing"

<PageTitle>Pricing · louis-agent</PageTitle>
<PageHead Description="What a website with an AI agent costs: two monthly plans from R500, what each includes, and what is quoted on a short call." />

<Band Id="top" Kicker="Pricing">
    <BandTitle Class="chrome">Two plans. No surprises.</BandTitle>
    <p class="lede">Both get you a website with an agent in its corner that knows your business and answers your customers day and night. The difference is how busy it gets and how much changing you want done for you.</p>
    <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="plan">
            <Tile Title="Starter" Value="R500" Note="a month, for a small business finding its feet">Your website, hosted and kept running, with the agent in its corner for up to 300 conversations a month. 30 minutes of changes a month, done for you. Leads mailed to you when a customer says yes, and what every answer cost, measured and shown.</Tile>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
            <Tile Title="Business" Value="R1,000" Note="a month, for a busier place with more to know" Delay="1">Everything in Starter, with the agent in its corner for up to 1,000 conversations a month and an hour of changes a month, done for you. Room for a full menu, many services and more pages.</Tile>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="band-note">A conversation is one customer's chat with the agent, however many questions they ask in it. Busier than that? We talk before it matters.</p>
</Band>

<Band Id="quoted" Kicker="Quoted on a short call">
    <h2 class="chrome">What we work out together.</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="panel">
            <h3>Building the site</h3>
            <p>A once-off fee to build the site, by its size. You get the number after a short call, before anything is built.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
            <h3>Your first files, written with you</h3>
            <p>What the agent knows lives in a few plain files. Louis can write your first Markdown files with you, for a fee, so the agent sounds like you from day one.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="band-note">Need more than a website, a custom agent that reads your mailbox or checks your reports? That is quoted on its own. <a href="/contact">Ask for yours</a>.</p>
</Band>
